config VIDEO_MTK_ISP_AOV
	tristate "Mediatek Always-On Vision (AOV) driver"
	help
	  Always-On Vision (AOV) driver for MediaTek SoCs.
	  Provides always-on face detection and AI vision processing
	  on the SCP (System Control Processor) subsystem.
	  Used with ISP7S/ISP7SP on MT6879/Dimensity 7030.

	  Choose m or y to enable this driver.
